[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "熱い絆で結ばれた仲間たち……か。\nなかなか粋な奴らじゃないか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Comrades bound by passionate bonds... Not bad. Quite chic."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あれで現状を打破できるなら、大したものだが",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "If their plan actually works, then color me impressed."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゴゥ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gou"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ヴァレリアがいるとはいえ、気が付いたら\nちょっと応援しちまってるな。良くないなぁ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Putting aside the fact that Valeria's part of the group - I found myself rooting for them before I knew it. That's really not like me..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "戻ってきたようです",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It looks like they're back."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゴゥ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gou"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ただいま戻りました！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We're back!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "おかえりレスナちゃん！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Welcome back, Resna!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "カカシ２体、バッチリ準備完了！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Two scarecrows, perfectly prepared!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "へえ、これが……ってなんかゴテゴテしてない？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Huh, so this is... Wait, aren't they a little overdone?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "せめて本物のお姫様と騎士みたいにしたくて……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I wanted them to look like a real princess and knight at least..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロロナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ロロナさんってそういう人よね……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It really resembles the real deal!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミミ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mimi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "まぁまぁミミちゃん。\nロロナ先生、どんな風に並べますか？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Now, now, Mimi. Miss Rorona, how should we place them?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "トトリ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Totori"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "並べて置いてあげようよ……寂しくないように",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Let's set them up next to each other... so they won't be lonely."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロロナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "よしっ、設置完了！\nヨハナ、本はどうなってる？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "All right, done! Johanna, how's the book looking?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "バッチリ、光ってるわよ。\nまぁ、まだ大勢残ってるしね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Perfect, it's glowing. Well, there are still a lot of us left."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あとは順番に出て行って出られるか確かめましょ。\n皆さん順番にどうぞ～",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Now let's take turns going out to see if we can leave. Everyone, please form a line!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ロロナ先輩、どうぞ。ドレス姿なので足元お気を付けて",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Miss Rorona, you go first. Mind the dress."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あ、あのね。帰る前に……ちょっといいかな？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Um, before I leave... could I say something?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロロナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]